# List of State Protected Monuments in Telangana

This is a list of State Protected Monuments as officially reported by and available through the website of the Archaeological Survey of India in the state Telangana, India. The monument identifier is a combination of the abbreviation of the subdivision of the list (state, ASI circle) and the numbering as published on the website of the ASI. 500 State Protected Monuments have been recognized by the ASI in Telangana. Besides the State Protected Monuments, also the Monuments of National Importance in this state might be relevant.
